---
layout: layouts/home.njk
title: "Journal visual direction · local study | Communitygeeks"
description: "Local preview of the homepage journal with article-specific astronaut scenes."
permalink: /mockups/journal-direction/
bodyClass: participation-home
---
{% set pieces = publicThinking %}
{% set lead = pieces[0] %}
{% set topicLabel = {'community-management-participation-strategy': 'Community & adoption', 'what-remains-human-when-ai-takes-over': 'AI & human judgment', 'who-keeps-the-thread': 'AI autonomy'} %}
<div class="jm-study-controls"><p><strong>Journal visual study</strong> · Article images · Preview only</p></div>
<section class="jm jm-prototype" aria-labelledby="jm-study-title">
  <h1 id="jm-study-title" class="jm-study-heading">Ideas tested against real work.</h1>
  <div class="jm-front">
    <article class="jm-lead">
      <a class="jm-lead-media" href="{{ lead.url }}" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
        <img src="/assets/images/mockups/journal-direction/lead-ai-builder.png" alt="" style="object-position:100% 50%">
        <span class="jm-obs">Obs. {{ lead.obs }}</span>
      </a>
      <div class="jm-lead-body">
        <span class="jm-lead-geo" aria-hidden="true"><span class="geo-disc"></span><span class="geo-ring"></span><span class="geo-square"></span><span class="geo-rule"></span></span>
        <p class="jm-meta"><span class="jm-tag">Latest</span><span>{{ lead.format }}</span><span>{{ lead.confidence }}</span><time datetime="{{ lead.date | isoDate }}">{{ lead.date | readableDate }}</time></p>
        <h2><a href="{{ lead.url }}">{{ lead.title }}</a></h2>
        <p class="jm-deck">{{ lead.summary }}</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="{{ lead.url }}">Read the field note <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        {% if lead.openQuestion %}<p class="jm-question"><span>Open question</span>{{ lead.openQuestion }}</p>{% endif %}
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
  <ol class="jm-shelf" aria-label="Also recent">
    {% for piece in pieces %}{% if loop.index > 1 and loop.index <= 4 %}
    {% if piece.slug == 'community-management-participation-strategy' %}{% set scene = 'cookie-sharing.png' %}
    {% elif piece.slug == 'what-remains-human-when-ai-takes-over' %}{% set scene = 'human-judgment.png' %}
    {% else %}{% set scene = 'thread-boundary.png' %}{% endif %}
    <li class="jm-card"><article>
      <span class="jm-card-scene" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/images/mockups/journal-direction/{{ scene }}" alt=""></span>
      <p class="jm-card-obs">Obs. {{ piece.obs }}</p>
      <h3 class="jm-card-title"><a class="jm-card-link" href="{{ piece.url }}">{{ piece.title }}</a></h3>
      <p class="jm-card-sum">{{ piece.summary }}</p>
      <p class="jm-meta"><time datetime="{{ piece.date | isoDate }}">{{ piece.date | readableDate }}</time><span>{{ topicLabel[piece.slug] or piece.topics[0] }}</span></p>
    </article></li>
    {% endif %}{% endfor %}
  </ol>
  <aside class="jm-research" aria-labelledby="jm-research-title">
    <span class="jm-research-geo" aria-hidden="true"><span class="geo-disc"></span><span class="geo-ring"></span><span class="geo-square"></span></span>
    <p class="jm-research-label">Research in progress</p>
    <div><h3 id="jm-research-title">When participant knowledge enters AI answers</h3><p>{{ researchTeaser.en }}</p></div>
    <a class="text-link" href="/public-thinking/#research">Follow the research <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </aside>
</section>
<section class="jm-art-review" aria-labelledby="jm-art-review-title">
  <h2 id="jm-art-review-title">Illustrations inside these articles</h2>
  <p>The homepage cards use one image each. These are all five astronaut studies for the three articles.</p>
  <div class="jm-art-review-grid">
    <figure><img src="/assets/images/mockups/journal-direction/platform-ecosystem.png" alt="Astronauts taking part inside and outside a transparent community platform"><figcaption>Obs. 005 · Platform and wider ecosystem</figcaption></figure>
    <figure><img src="/assets/images/mockups/journal-direction/cookie-sharing.png" alt="One astronaut offers a cookie from a shared constellation jar to another arriving astronaut"><figcaption>Obs. 005 · The shared cookie jar <span>Used on card</span></figcaption></figure>
    <figure><img src="/assets/images/mockups/journal-direction/human-judgment.png" alt="Astronaut at a constellation observatory control desk choosing a route"><figcaption>Obs. 004 · Human judgment <span>Used on card</span></figcaption></figure>
    <figure><img src="/assets/images/mockups/journal-direction/independent-verification.png" alt="Astronaut checking a distant reference point through a separate constellation telescope"><figcaption>Obs. 004 · Independent verification</figcaption></figure>
    <figure><img src="/assets/images/mockups/journal-direction/thread-boundary.png" alt="Astronaut, constellation drone and robot connected by a coral thread inside a low boundary"><figcaption>Obs. 003 · The thread and its boundary <span>Used on card</span></figcaption></figure>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .jm-study-controls{padding:20px var(--pad);background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font:500 14px var(--body)}
  .jm-study-heading{margin:0 0 32px;font:360 clamp(28px,3vw,44px)/1.1 var(--display);letter-spacing:-.025em}
  .jm-prototype .jm-lead h2{margin:14px 0;font:360 clamp(30px,2.8vw,44px)/1.05 var(--display);letter-spacing:-.024em;max-width:22ch}
  .jm-prototype .jm-card-scene{display:block;aspect-ratio:16/9;margin:0 0 16px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--space-1)}
  .jm-prototype .jm-card-scene img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
  .jm-art-review{padding:clamp(40px,5vw,80px) var(--pad);background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink)}
  .jm-art-review h2{font:360 clamp(28px,3vw,44px)/1.1 var(--display)}
  .jm-art-review>p{margin:10px 0 30px;color:var(--ink-muted)}
  .jm-art-review-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:28px}
  .jm-art-review figure{margin:0}
  .jm-art-review img{display:block;width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;object-fit:cover;background:var(--space-1)}
  .jm-art-review figcaption{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:10px 0;font:500 12px var(--mono)}
  .jm-art-review figcaption span{color:var(--signal-ink)}
  @media(max-width:900px){
    .jm-prototype .jm-card article{display:block;padding:0 0 16px}
    .jm-prototype .jm-card article>:not(.jm-card-scene){margin-inline:16px}
    .jm-prototype .jm-card-scene{aspect-ratio:16/9;margin:0 0 16px}
    .jm-art-review-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  }
</style>
